<title>JAPAN: Sanwa Bank to open Manila office.</title>
<headline>Sanwa Bank to open Manila office.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sanwa Bank Ltd said on Monday it will open a representative office in Manila on Tuesday to deal with growing Japanese business in the Philippines.</p>
<p>Through the office, Sanwa will strengthen its links with Risal Commercial Banking Corp, with which it has capital participation, and help the Philippine bank offer a wider range of financial services, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Sanwa has a total of 25 branches, 11 subsidiaries and 25 representative offices overseas, it said.</p>
</text>
